  "title": "Sheet: one branch per tool that uses this mechanic. A spec's data must match at least one branch.",
  "description": "Merged as anyOf branches (kit 0.2.0). Branches: Dependency, four-questions-map, route-card, deal-record, institution-map, clause-reader. The validator's schema-lite reports the first error of each branch when none match.",
  "anyOf": [
    {
